# direnv entry point for the metacraft-labs fork of aztec-packages.
#
# `direnv allow` once; thereafter every shell under this tree gets the wasm
# barretenberg toolchain from nix: wasi-sdk 33 (NOT the 27 cpp/bootstrap.sh
# downloads, which cannot compile C++ exceptions), cmake, ninja, clang 20, the
# clang-format-20 alias scripts/remake-constants.sh insists on, and
# CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 for the FetchContent'd dependencies that
# predate CMake 3.5.
#
# Downstream-only file: it exists so the fork is usable without a host
# toolchain, and is not intended for upstream.

watch_file flake.nix
watch_file flake.lock
watch_file nix/wasi-sdk.nix

use flake
